Bilink Native CLI Binary License

This package contains a platform-specific Bilink native CLI binary.

The native binary is not licensed under an open-source license. Use, copying,
redistribution, and modification of the native binary are governed by the
Bilink Terms of Service or a separate written agreement with Bilink AI.

Source code that is separately published by Bilink AI under an open-source
license remains governed by that source project's license. This license file
only describes the platform-specific native binary distributed in this package.
